    <!--
      Korean. Machine translation, reviewed for consistency of terminology.

      Left untranslated on purpose: the app name, Shizuku and ADB (product names), the adb
      command itself, and WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS, which has to be typed exactly as written.

      setup_use_shizuku is matched as a substring inside setup_secure_settings_shizuku, to
      bold it. Word it differently in the two places and nothing is bolded, silently.
    -->
